# Portfolio essentials

- Stack: Nest API (`apps/api`) + Next web (`apps/web`) + CRM (`apps/crm`) + Docker/dssh + Go CDN. Orient: `./bin/agent-cli orient`.
- Package manager: npm workspaces. Prefer `./bin/agent-cli` over guessing npm/dssh.
- Git: feature `feature/<user>/development/<name>` → merge **`development`** (no feature PR). Never land on `master` unless asked. Local branch required. Same-VM: `git worktree add`. After push/merge of `development`, sync Austen’s main `development` checkout. Details: `docs/git-commit-preferences.md`.
- Lint: `./bin/agent-cli lint` (fail-closed prefs). Workspace `lint -w apps/*` skips prefs.
- Never: mutate shared checkout in place; silently docker kill/rm `portfolio-api`/`portfolio-crm`; fake missing forge/repo/env access.
- Full rule map: `docs/cursor-rules-progressive-disclosure.md`. Read topic docs under `docs/agent/` when relevant.
